{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:34 2026-07-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:34 2026-07-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:34 2026-07-27 HKT</p><p>屯門有船隻發生火警。今日（27日）早上10時31分，警方接報指三聖邨避風塘有一艘船冒煙起火。水警輪和消防船分別趕到，惟火警已由船家自行救熄。人員經調查，相信是船上俗稱「火牛」的變壓器短路起火，事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p><img alt=\"消防員在涉事船隻上調查。陳景楠攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acf35dc87b8d697177ab8f0c7ef589ee/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bf575745a51fb292e19792e544d54f5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_51.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e50fa2f872871e65c0fa7c4dff09819e/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_50_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事船隻（左三）變壓器短路起火，火警被救熄，無人受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c064eba6afc2b1ba5a8a9c0f0b6293f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水警輪和消防船到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bd30c0499ed65f892ba142fa5a1603d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_51_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98c6ed62531265a6a24b9d4c58763b2c/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_51_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1121cd4d5863e9304378be28bf7317d5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_50_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0810736ea5373e2ebcf9e6c9c6ec8ea/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-27_at_11_10_49.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T03:58:22.956240+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}